# ============================================================
# 换行符与文件类型规范
#
# 目的：避免跨平台协作时 CRLF / LF 被互相改写。
#   - 源码统一 LF
#   - Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF（改成 LF 后双击可能异常）
#   - 二进制资源不做换行转换
# ============================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.db   binary
*.woff2 binary

# 导出的依赖清单不要参与 diff 统计
requirements.txt linguist-vendored
